  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<div><p><span>From Newton&rsquo;s law of gravitation, we have: </span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mi>m</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <msub> <mi>m</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msup> <mi>r</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math> </span></p><p><span>or&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mi>F</mi><msup> <mi>r</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mi>m</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <msub> <mi>m</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math> </span></p><p><span>Substituting the dimensions of all physical quantities:</span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mi>MLT</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math> </span></p><p><span>or&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></math> </span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span>Its SI unit is &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msup><mi>kg</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>or</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>kg</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> </span></p></div>",
